Nothing third-party is redistributed here. None of this pack's host programs comes
from a package manager: UAC and Velociraptor are installed from a pinned release
download that an image build checks against the sha256 in requires/host.json, and CyLR
is declared and installed in no image. The pack asks for no Python package. Each
program carries its own licence and none of them travels inside this pack.
